{"screen_name": "monokuro_graf", "file": "monokuro_graf-ea4b76", "name": "ものくろ@ありがとうございました。", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1605832915841007616/lbvshSjk.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/868050589925613569/1673843932/1500x500", "description": "釣り、登山、キャンプ。野鳥すき。喫茶店巡り好き。アウトドア大好き。コーギーのイルザと暮らす。", "total_works": 34, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2026-03-21T00:49:24.028552+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-21T00:49:24.028552+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 7000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-21T00:49:24.028552+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 7000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 7000, "max": 7000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/monokuro_graf", "name": "monokuro_graf"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://monokuro-graf.fanbox.cc", "name": ""}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@monokuro_graf/works/34", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7e7a1784/uploads/origins/8e428b88-90b0-47af-abf8-a155a8c64cab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a49d4429335fb478bc072792425fb4bc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7e7a1784/uploads/origins/8e428b88-90b0-47af-abf8-a155a8c64cab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a49d4429335fb478bc072792425fb4bc, https://si.imgix.net/7e7a1784/uploads/origins/8e428b88-90b0-47af-abf8-a155a8c64cab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=05baf04fe9a19575378d978406d013b4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7e7a1784/uploads/origins/8e428b88-90b0-47af-abf8-a155a8c64cab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=94b7e4a414913f69e1b53143b3c8bb5d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "今年引っ越しをしたので、\n引っ越し業者クルロスをください！\n構図やポーズは指定ありません。\nただ、制服がアー○引っ越しセンターっぽいやつだと助かります。\n\nよろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@monokuro_graf/works/33", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/996f9524/uplo