s/bd1934d0-2625-4f35-8fe6-943ce4f2d687?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=527cb9445bff62ce95b0f07e6afd25fc 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "バルクホルンさん、マリアペアでお願いします！\n服装はできればシクオペ時っぽいのがいいです(大変だったら書きやすい服でいいです)\n構図や表情などはおまかせします", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@monokuro_graf/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/313153bc/uploads/origins/7eaa135b-2f8d-4d21-82d4-68f93811cf02?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=403a85b4c5a84d48ef9e5504efbcfbe6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/313153bc/uploads/origins/7eaa135b-2f8d-4d21-82d4-68f93811cf02?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=403a85b4c5a84d48ef9e5504efbcfbe6, https://si.imgix.net/313153bc/uploads/origins/7eaa135b-2f8d-4d21-82d4-68f93811cf02?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d57d14592ff1cb3feb40db4cb8f959bf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/313153bc/uploads/origins/7eaa135b-2f8d-4d21-82d4-68f93811cf02?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f052bcabb18e32a1305650fc1fd0ff0f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "芳佳ちゃん、ジニーちゃんペアでお願いします！\n服装はできればシクオペ時っぽいのがいいです(大変だったら書きやすい服でいいです)\n構図や表情などはおまかせします", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@monokuro_graf/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/eca3d62e/uploads/origins/5845155e-9c2d-4898-b0c7-4fbb18271020?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d502236f894fe2f76cebcced7aef1006", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/eca3d62e/uploads/origins/5845155e-9c2d-4898-b0c7-4fbb18271020?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d502236f894fe2f76cebcced7aef1006, https://si.imgix.net/eca3d62e/uploads/origins/5845155e-9c2d-4898-b0c7-4fbb18271020?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d9d8247b25923d0fb39bb452b6a71801 2x, https: